      "sourceTextSha256": "4f0ba1a0888397c0edcc6df4a812fad4f958f2fc5dab551356b94d54beed0e32",
      "text": "Day 10 · Breakfast, then a private panoramic tour (4 hours) with an English-speaking guide: the Bay of Cartagena, the Muelle de los Pegasos, the Clock Tower and the Manga neighbourhood, with its Moorish and Republican architecture; the imposing Castillo de San Felipe de Barajas; and the walled historic centre, with time for craft shopping and a walk through its streets and squares, including the Church of San Pedro Claver and the Santo Domingo bastion.",
