    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a8704e80dc128a8",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4070362dcbd2e877b82474ce999b142ad79d860188975777c8fe5784979c6b3f",
      "text": "Day 11 · Breakfast and transfer to the Bodeguita pier for a speedboat to the Rosario Islands (about 45 minutes), past the Bay of Cartagena, Bocachica and the forts of San Fernando and San José, then along the island of Barú to the islands’ crystal-clear water. Free time to enjoy the sea and the facilities, with a typical Caribbean lunch. Return to Cartagena in the afternoon (8 hours).\nIncluded: Hotel – pier – hotel transfers · Island tour with typical lunch (shared) · Breakfast\nNot included: Sailing and Coralia taxes (USD 10) · Oceanarium (USD 10)",
